	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d11r0401_assistantm_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こんかいの　じっけんは
とても　うまく　いったぞ！▼
きみ　この
かいふくのくすりを　あげるよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:41:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:40:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>今回の　実験は
とても　うまく　いったぞ！▼
きみ　この
かいふくのくすりを　あげるよ▼</Text>
