	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d11r0401_assistantm_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あしたは　あしたの　かぜがふく！▼
ぼくは　まいにち　じっけんする
よければ　けっかを　みにおいでよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:45:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:40:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>明日は　明日の　風が吹く！▼
ぼくは　毎日　実験する
よければ　結果を　みにおいでよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T02:47:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:40:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アイテム入手後
　日付が変わるまで繰り返し</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:40:41" />
		</CommentCell>
